{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/001c1914d46b4b3597576386edfef766.webp?t=1748520773\" width=600 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Detective Hakeem, a detective with the local law enforcement who has been sent to investigate the death of the wealthy heir, only to find out that he was expected! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with suspects, investigate the environment, and solve the many puzzles left behind by Amir to uncover Amir and his guests' entangled past and what transpired during his last party.<br><br>\u200e <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/43664da96bb40544d278f6bd819e2834.poster.avif?t=1748520773\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/43664da96bb40544d278f6bd819e2834.webm?t=1748520773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/43664da96bb40544d278f6bd819e2834.mp4?t=1748520773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/fd842249da8b6d3a37512a6c9e520182.webp?t=1748520773\" width=600 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment to solve puzzles and find hidden clues throughout Amir\u2019s mansion. Speak with suspects to be transported into a recreation of the events from their point of view, where you will be able to find discrepancies to help you find the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/ad853561f325e6b4c98a7f7fa09bc19e.poster.avif?t=1748520773\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/ad853561f325e6b4c98a7f7fa09bc19e.webm?t=1748520773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/ad853561f325e6b4c98a7f7fa09bc19e.mp4?t=1748520773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/ce21b97c6c773ed9274813585f3d7c8a.webp?t=1748520773\" width=600 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with six different suspects, all carefully curated and written, who share an elaborate and sometimes interconnected past, all with motives not only to kill Amir, but to throw each other under the bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/271bf7e9a67fea6cd4126b61496d2a48.poster.avif?t=1748520773\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/271bf7e9a67fea6cd4126b61496d2a48.webm?t=1748520773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985760/extras/271bf7e9a67fea6cd4126b61496d2a48.mp4?t=1748520773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"